            {
                "entry_id": "d4f193cf-fdf6-328a-b9f4-5f7ff4670b40",
                "word": "XOR",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0a0ed31e-ed1f-4ada-a091-f0af929500ad",
                        "entry_id": "d4f193cf-fdf6-328a-b9f4-5f7ff4670b40",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "XORs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1cf496b6-1967-3516-b663-8b7678938e58",
                        "entry_id": "d4f193cf-fdf6-328a-b9f4-5f7ff4670b40",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The connective \\\"exclusive or\\\". One way to state its meaning in plain English is \\\"if either A or B, but not if both.\\"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc946f96-453a-4aa1-ae21-6452ef9b01eb",
                                "sense_id": "1cf496b6-1967-3516-b663-8b7678938e58",
                                "text": "The XOR of (0,0) is 0; (0,1) is 1; (1,0) is 1; and (1,1) is 0."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae55cbf5-9f2e-4623-b53f-052672a6b53d",
                                "sense_id": "1cf496b6-1967-3516-b663-8b7678938e58",
                                "text": "The XOR gate can take only two inputs at a time and give an output. The output of the XOR gate is high (1) only when its two inputs are dissimilar i.e., if one of them is low (0) then other one will be high (1)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "001e08fd-e430-3734-bf72-c9fb734e6eff",
                        "entry_id": "d4f193cf-fdf6-328a-b9f4-5f7ff4670b40",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A logic gate that implements \\\"exclusive or\\\"."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1141f5f4-16c9-3360-a229-7688b9637e36",
                        "entry_id": "d4f193cf-fdf6-328a-b9f4-5f7ff4670b40",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The symbolic representation that implements \\\"exclusive or\\\"."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7848347-de4f-4017-a245-d5d2adba5187",
                                "sense_id": "1141f5f4-16c9-3360-a229-7688b9637e36",
                                "text": "XOR can be used to add bits without carrying."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
